  "description": "Never forget where you came from. At YT, our roots are firmly within freeride. The TUES CORE 1 is a testament to that: a 27.5\" rig that lets you play with fire as you hunt down the biggest sends in the bike park. It's equipped for the needs of new-school freeride, and with a durable, hand-crafted aluminum frame, you know this bike can withstand a slam or three. Based on our Rampage-proven MK3 frame, this build features our V4L suspension linkage and packs more pop than mainstream radio. Marzocchi suspension is in place to eat up the impacts, while a range of the industry's burliest components works hard to keep you out of the workshop, however hard you've sent it. Our freeride legacy runs deep. With TUES CORE 1, we embrace it.",
